('jamb','7b884a45-4327-4631-8b62-0679b6e3f25d'::uuid,'Money & Banking','Inflation targeting is best described as a framework in which a central bank:','[{"id":"A","text":"Announces an inflation target and commits policy toward achieving it"},{"id":"B","text":"Fixes every market price directly"},{"id":"C","text":"Eliminates all commercial banks"},{"id":"D","text":"Sets company profit margins"}]'::jsonb,'A','CBN describes inflation targeting as a forward-looking framework centred on an announced inflation target.','medium','Central Bank of Nigeria','https://www.cbn.gov.ng/MonetaryPolicy/decisions.html','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
